('MER-SUP-002','Third Parties','Critical supplier assessment','Suppliers supporting critical services or sensitive processing shall undergo proportionate pre-contract and ongoing assessment, including security, resilience, financial, legal, AI and sub-supplier risks.'),
('MER-SUP-003','Third Parties','Contract controls','Material supplier contracts shall contain applicable security, privacy, audit, incident, continuity, data location, subcontracting, portability, exit and regulatory-access terms.'),
('MER-SUP-004','Third Parties','Exit tested','Critical third-party arrangements shall have credible exit, substitution or continuity strategies tested at a frequency proportional to concentration and switching difficulty.'),
