('MER-OPS-002','Operations','Observability','Material services shall emit telemetry sufficient to understand user experience, system health, dependencies, security signals and business outcomes.'),
('MER-OPS-003','Operations','Runbooks as executable knowledge','Frequent or critical operational procedures shall be automated or expressed as executable, tested runbooks where practical.'),
('MER-OPS-004','Operations','Toil budget','Teams shall measure repetitive manual operational toil and maintain an explicit improvement backlog when toil exceeds their locally defined threshold.'),
('MER-OPS-005','Operations','Change traceability','Production changes shall be attributable to an identity, source revision, build, approval/policy decision, deployment event and resulting health evidence.'),
('MER-OPS-006','Operations','End-of-life','Technology assets, services, models and dependencies shall have lifecycle status and planned treatment for unsupported or obsolete components.'),
