('MER-PPL-002','People','Craft communities','Professional disciplines shall maintain communities of practice that curate patterns, coach peers and improve shared standards without becoming approval bottlenecks.'),
('MER-PPL-003','People','AI literacy','People who develop, procure, govern or use AI shall receive role-appropriate training in capabilities, limitations, risk, verification, security, privacy and acceptable use.'),
('MER-PPL-004','People','Psychological safety','Operating practices shall make it safe to surface uncertainty, defects, incidents and risk early; incentives that reward concealment or late escalation are non-conformant.'),
('MER-PPL-005','People','Sustainable focus','Teams shall protect focus time, limit unmanaged work in progress, design on-call sustainably and track cognitive load and recurring friction as operational risks.'),
